{"ref":"BDB, דַּל²","hw":"דַּל²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">דַּל</span></big>  <strong>adj. low, weak, poor, thin</strong> (especially common in Wisd. lit. and poet.)—<span dir=\"rtl\">דַּל</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:21\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.21\">Lv 14:21</a> + 8 times, <span dir=\"rtl\">דָּל֑</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 23:3\" href=\"/Exodus.23.3\">Ex 23:3</a> + 17 times + <span dir=\"rtl\">דָּל֥</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 82:3\" href=\"/Psalms.82.3\">ψ 82:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּלִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 2:7\" href=\"/Amos.2.7\">Am 2:7</a> + 17 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּלּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:19\" href=\"/Genesis.41.19\">Gn 41:19</a>;—<em>weak, thin</em>, of kine <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:19\" href=\"/Genesis.41.19\">Gn 41:19</a> (E); of Amnon <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 13:4\" href=\"/II_Samuel.13.4\">2 S 13:4</a>; <em>weak</em>, of family of Saul <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 3:1\" href=\"/II_Samuel.3.1\">2 S 3:1</a> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">חָזֵק</span>) cf. <a data-ref=\"Judges 6:15\" href=\"/Judges.6.15\">Ju 6:15</a>; <em>reduced, poor</em> (opp. rich) <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:21\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.21\">Lv 14:21</a> (P) <a data-ref=\"Ruth 3:10\" href=\"/Ruth.3.10\">Ru 3:10</a> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">עָשִׁיר</span>) <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 5:4\" href=\"/Jeremiah.5.4\">Je 5:4</a> (opp. to <span dir=\"rtl\">הגדולים</span>, v <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 5:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.5.5\">5</a>) <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 28:15\" href=\"/Proverbs.28.15\">Pr 28:15</a> <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 3:12\" href=\"/Zephaniah.3.12\">Zp 3:12</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(עַם עָנִי וָדָל֑)</span>; mostly subst., <strong>a</strong> <em>poor</em> (man), <em>the poor</em> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 23:3\" href=\"/Exodus.23.3\">Ex 23:3</a> (JE); opp. to <span dir=\"rtl\">עָשִׁיר</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 30:15\" href=\"/Exodus.30.15\">Ex 30:15</a> (P) <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 10:15\" href=\"/Proverbs.10.15\">Pr 10:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 22:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.22.16\">22:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 28:11\" href=\"/Proverbs.28.11\">28:11</a>; opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">הוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:4\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.4\">Pr 19:4</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אביון</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 2:8\" href=\"/I_Samuel.2.8\">1 S 2:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 5:16\" href=\"/Job.5.16\">Jb 5:16</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 72:13\" href=\"/Psalms.72.13\">ψ 72:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 82:4\" href=\"/Psalms.82.4\">82:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 113:7\" href=\"/Psalms.113.7\">113:7</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:31\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.31\">Pr 14:31</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 14:30\" href=\"/Isaiah.14.30\">Is 14:30</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 25:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.25.4\">25:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Amos 4:1\" href=\"/Amos.4.1\">Am 4:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Amos 8:6\" href=\"/Amos.8.6\">8:6</a>; cf. also <a data-ref=\"Job 20:10\" href=\"/Job.20.10\">Jb 20:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Job 20:19\" href=\"/Job.20.19\">19</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 22:9\" href=\"/Proverbs.22.9\">Pr 22:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 39:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.39.10\">Je 39:10</a>; <em>reduced, weak, helpless</em> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עני</span>) <a data-ref=\"Job 34:28\" href=\"/Job.34.28\">Jb 34:28</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 82:3\" href=\"/Psalms.82.3\">ψ 82:3</a> (‖ also <span dir=\"rtl\">יתום</span>), <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 22:22\" href=\"/Proverbs.22.22\">Pr 22:22</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.2\">Is 10:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 11:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.11.4\">11:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 26:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.26.6\">26:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Amos 2:7\" href=\"/Amos.2.7\">Am 2:7</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אלמנה</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 31:16\" href=\"/Job.31.16\">Jb 31:16</a>; opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁוֹעַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 34:19\" href=\"/Job.34.19\">Jb 34:19</a>;—cf. also <a data-ref=\"Psalms 41:2\" href=\"/Psalms.41.2\">ψ 41:2</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:17\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.17\">Pr 19:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 21:13\" href=\"/Proverbs.21.